1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:08,720
Nine out of ten deaf babies are born to
hearing parents.

2
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,507
Overnight, those parents need a new
language.

3
00:00:12,587 --> 00:00:15,065
But learning from a video is hard.

4
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:20,333
The signer faces you, so you have to flip
every movement in your head.

5
00:00:20,413 --> 00:00:23,720
And nobody tells you if your hands are
right.

6
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,378
So I built Signsprout.

7
00:00:26,458 --> 00:00:30,690
It opens from a link in the Quest browser.

8
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:35,720
You stay seated, and all you need are your
hands.

9
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,542
There's no wall of text.

10
00:00:38,622 --> 00:00:40,460
Poke "Let's begin".

11
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:44,599
Hold up your hands, and Sprout sees them.

12
00:00:44,679 --> 00:00:47,526
Pick the hand you write with.

13
00:00:47,606 --> 00:00:53,683
Then touch your chin, so Signsprout knows
where your face is,

14
00:00:53,763 --> 00:00:57,720
and every sign lands in the right place.

15
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,229
Every sign has four steps.

16
00:01:01,309 --> 00:01:02,784
First, watch.

17
00:01:02,864 --> 00:01:09,720
Sprout signs face to face, mirrored, so
it's easy to copy.

18
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:16,409
Then, glowing guide hands appear right
where your hands are.

19
00:01:16,489 --> 00:01:20,916
Put your hands inside them, and sign
along.

20
00:01:20,996 --> 00:01:29,720
Signsprout reads twenty-five joints on
each hand, and tells you exactly what to
fix.

21
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:35,435
Now it's your turn, from memory.

22
00:01:35,515 --> 00:01:45,734
It checks the handshape, the place, the
palm and the movement,

23
00:01:45,814 --> 00:01:49,720
the way a teacher would.

24
00:01:50,200 --> 00:02:01,720
Get it right, and a new plant sprouts in
your garden.

25
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,662
Your garden is your progress.

26
00:02:04,742 --> 00:02:08,868
Plants grow as signs move into long-term
memory,

27
00:02:08,948 --> 00:02:12,724
and droop a little when it's time to
review.

28
00:02:12,804 --> 00:02:17,720
Sessions take five minutes, so they fit
before bath time.

29
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:24,806
On your phone, tell Sprout what you need,
like "words for bath time".

30
00:02:24,886 --> 00:02:30,522
The AI coach builds a plan from signs
Signsprout can check,

31
00:02:30,602 --> 00:02:33,720
and it's waiting in your headset.

32
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:35,471
Left-handed?

33
00:02:35,551 --> 00:02:37,386
Every sign flips.

34
00:02:37,466 --> 00:02:45,720
Limited finger movement, high contrast,
calm motion: they're all built in.

35
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,013
Signsprout.

36
00:02:47,093 --> 00:02:51,720
Learn to sign with your own two hands,
five minutes a day.
